      fullBio: `Laibon Mbatian was the most powerful spiritual leader the Maasai people have ever known. Born into the Inkidongi clan the hereditary lineage of Maasai laibons Mbatian inherited both the gift of prophecy and the sacred role of intermediary between the Maasai and their god Enkai. His leadership came during one of the most turbulent periods in Maasai history, as the rinderpest epidemic of the 1890s decimated Maasai cattle and the first European settlers began encroaching on their lands. His prophecies, passed down orally for generations, warned of an "iron snake" crossing the land widely interpreted as the Uganda Railway and the coming of strangers who would reshape the world the Maasai had known.`,
